# Keep the deployment to what the site actually serves.
#
# The photography archive and the source video files stay in the repo for
# local work, but never reach Vercel:
#   · public/lifestyle/* originals  →  only /lifestyle/web is published
#   · public/video/*                →  production streams from Vercel Blob
#                                      (see src/data/blobVideos.js) and the
#                                      hero loops from Cloudinary
#
# Anything referenced by the running site must live in public/lifestyle/web.

public/lifestyle/cabo-del-sol
public/lifestyle/villas-cds
public/lifestyle/anima-village
public/lifestyle/park-hyatt-cdmx
public/lifestyle/soho-residences
public/lifestyle/renders
public/lifestyle/unsorted

public/video
